      "sp.weight-loss.t01": "Weight loss",
      "sp.weight-loss.t02": "Lose weight without turning eating into a <em class=\"accent\">second job</em>.",
      "sp.weight-loss.t03": "Weight loss comes down to one thing: a gentle, consistent calorie deficit you can actually keep up. Fotocal makes the tracking part almost effortless — you take a photo, it does the maths — so you can focus on the habit instead of the spreadsheet.",
      "sp.weight-loss.t04": "The method",
      "sp.weight-loss.t05": "Four steps to steady, <em class=\"accent\">sustainable</em> loss.",
      "sp.weight-loss.t06": "No crash diets, no banned foods. Just a repeatable loop that fits around your real life.",
      "sp.weight-loss.t07": "Set a realistic target",
      "sp.weight-loss.t08": "Tell Fotocal your age, height, weight, activity and goal. It sets a daily calorie and macro target aimed at a safe ~0.5&ndash;1&nbsp;kg per week — fast enough to see progress, gentle enough to keep.",
      "sp.weight-loss.t09": "Log meals with a photo",
      "sp.weight-loss.t10": "Snap your plate and the AI estimates calories and macros in seconds. When logging is this quick, you actually keep doing it — and consistency is what drives weight loss.",
      "sp.weight-loss.t11": "Stay in a gentle deficit",
      "sp.weight-loss.t12": "Your calorie ring shows how much room is left in the day. Fotocal nudges you toward higher-protein, higher-quality choices so you feel full on fewer calories.",
      "sp.weight-loss.t13": "Follow the trend, not the scale",
      "sp.weight-loss.t14": "Weight bounces daily with water and salt. Fotocal's weight chart smooths the noise so you can see the real direction — and adjust with your Weekly Report.",
      "sp.weight-loss.t15": "Why the photo matters",
      "sp.weight-loss.t16": "Effortless logging is the whole game",
      "sp.weight-loss.t17": "Most people quit calorie counting in the first week — not because it does not work, but because it is tedious. Fotocal removes the tedium. A photo replaces the database search, the weighing and the guessing, so the habit survives past day three.",
      "sp.weight-loss.t18": "AI photo scanning for home-cooked and restaurant meals",
      "sp.weight-loss.t19": "Barcode scanner for packaged food",
      "sp.weight-loss.t20": "Quality score points you at more filling, lower-calorie swaps",
      "sp.weight-loss.t21": "Automatic step tracking with Health Connect feeds your daily budget",
      "sp.weight-loss.t22": "Staying consistent",
      "sp.weight-loss.t23": "A coach in your pocket for the hard days",
      "sp.weight-loss.t24": "Plateaus and social meals are where diets fall apart. Coach Kal knows your diary and goals, so it can tell you what to order at a restaurant, why the scale has stalled, or how to spend the calories you have left — without guilt or extreme rules.",
      "sp.weight-loss.t25": "Coach Kal: practical, judgement-free advice 24/7",
      "sp.weight-loss.t26": "Streaks turn daily logging into a habit",
      "sp.weight-loss.t27": "Weekly Report shows what worked and what to change",
      "sp.weight-loss.t28": "Log by photo, voice or barcode — whichever is fastest",
      "sp.weight-loss.t30": "The best foods for weight loss",
      "sp.weight-loss.t31": "How fast should you lose weight?",
      "sp.weight-loss.t32": "The calorie deficit, explained",
      "sp.weight-loss.t33": "Start losing weight the sustainable way.",
      "sp.weight-loss.t34": "Download Fotocal, set your goal, and let a photo do the hard part.",
      "sp.nutrition-diet.t01": "Nutrition &amp; diet",
      "sp.nutrition-diet.t02": "Understand what you eat — <em class=\"accent\">not just how much</em>.",
      "sp.nutrition-diet.t03": "Calories are only half the story. Fotocal shows you the protein, carbs and fat behind every meal, scores its quality, and suggests healthier swaps — so you eat better, not just less. It fits whatever way you like to eat.",
      "sp.nutrition-diet.t04": "What every meal tells you",
