      "sp.nutrition-diet.t29": "\"What should I order at an Italian tonight?\" \"How do I get more protein without more calories?\" Coach Kal sees your diary and goals and answers with specific, realistic advice — plus personalised recommendations and a Weekly Report that shows how your nutrition is really trending.",
      "sp.nutrition-diet.t31": "Macronutrients 101",
