      "sp.lifestyle-mindset.t01": "Lifestyle &amp; mindset",
      "sp.lifestyle-mindset.t02": "Healthy habits that <em class=\"accent\">actually stick</em>.",
      "sp.lifestyle-mindset.t03": "The hardest part of eating well is not knowing what to do — it is keeping it up when life gets busy. Fotocal is built around the psychology of habit: small wins, gentle nudges, and a coach that never makes you feel guilty.",
      "sp.lifestyle-mindset.t04": "How habits form",
      "sp.lifestyle-mindset.t05": "Small wins, <em class=\"accent\">repeated</em>.",
      "sp.lifestyle-mindset.t06": "Fotocal is designed so the healthy choice is also the easy one — and every day you show up, it gets easier.",
      "sp.lifestyle-mindset.t07": "Make it effortless",
      "sp.lifestyle-mindset.t08": "A photo is all it takes to log a meal. When the effort is tiny, the habit survives the busy days that usually break it.",
      "sp.lifestyle-mindset.t09": "Build a streak",
      "sp.lifestyle-mindset.t10": "Your daily streak turns consistency into a small game worth protecting. Momentum, not motivation, is what carries you.",
      "sp.lifestyle-mindset.t11": "Reflect, don't punish",
      "sp.lifestyle-mindset.t12": "A quick mood note next to your meals reveals how food and feelings connect — awareness, never guilt.",
      "sp.lifestyle-mindset.t13": "Adjust weekly",
      "sp.lifestyle-mindset.t14": "Your Weekly Report celebrates what went well and points at one small thing to change — a sustainable pace of improvement.",
      "sp.lifestyle-mindset.t15": "The right mindset",
      "sp.lifestyle-mindset.t16": "No guilt, no all-or-nothing",
      "sp.lifestyle-mindset.t17": "One indulgent meal does not undo your progress — quitting does. Coach Kal is built to keep you going after a slip instead of spiralling, with encouragement that treats you like an adult.",
      "sp.lifestyle-mindset.t18": "Judgement-free coaching, available any time",
