      "sp.lifestyle-mindset.t20": "Focus on the trend, not one bad day",
      "sp.lifestyle-mindset.t21": "Fits real life",
      "sp.lifestyle-mindset.t22": "Gentle structure that stays out of the way",
      "sp.lifestyle-mindset.t23": "Fotocal supports your routine rather than ruling it — reminders arrive when they help, and logging takes seconds however you do it.",
